# Scripts

There is no `tests/` tree. Do not add unittest/pytest packages or a `tests/` folder unless the user asks.

Ops scripts only:

- `scripts/setup_sip.py` — LiveKit inbound trunk + dispatch rule (`--dry-run` / `--list` before `--replace`)
- `scripts/list_voices.py` — list ElevenLabs voices; `--set` writes `.env`

Keep `sys.path` inserts in scripts (this repo is not an installed package). Dummy keys belong only in throwaway CLIs, never in `src/`.
